{"type":"tool_result","callId":"call_f6fb0302c42e4100b2d8239b","status":"completed","result":"--- 341e19e diff ---\ncommit 341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143\nAuthor:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nAuthorDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\nCommit:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nCommitDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\n\n    Open morning release with desk meter reading at 21:00\n\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex dfc3792..1420412 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -3,3 +3,5 @@\n 本题是合成的电量调度研究；数据不代表任何机场的实际设施。输入是 night.json。四格各半小时，一格最多服务一台车，允许降功率。chargerKw 和 siteLimitKw 均指交流侧，batteryKwh 是电池侧；每格楼宇负荷在交流侧先占用接入容量。车辆仅在 [fromSlot,untilSlot) 在场，离场即核查所需电量。车辆在场时静止、不耗电。电池不超过 capacityKwh。低温仅改变表中指定的建筑负荷。可延期的负荷只可从 shiftFromSlot 原量搬至 shiftToSlot，不得削减总楼宇用电。\n \n 提交 model.mjs，导出 plan(night, efficiency)，输入相同单位、相同两辆车与四格窗口，可用数值求解或解析法。返回 {normal,cold,shifted,minShiftKw}。每个场景给出 {acKw:[四格交流充电功率],feasible:true或false}；即使不可行也给出物理可行、尽力满足各独立离场窗口的功率表。minShiftKw 为低温下满足两车的最小平移功率；无解时它和 shifted 均为 null。正常调度与低温调度的楼宇负荷分别按原值、加 coldExtraKw 计算。保留输入并在 HANDOVER.md 说明每车的缺口、最小平移及较低效率时的决定。\n+\n+本班业务工单见 TASK.md，工作表及值班操作见 operations/desk.md。\ndiff --git a/TASK.md b/TASK.md\nindex c5d77d9..5f3f365 100644\n--- a/TASK.md\n+++ b/TASK.md\n@@ -1 +1 @@\n-明早两辆摆渡车必须按表出车。夜班主管拿到一份“整夜电量够用”的估算，请给出是否可按原计划发车的调度意见。还要评估低温时段的额外楼宇负荷：若需要调整可延后的楼宇用电，算出最少调整量和可执行的半小时充电表。说明在哪种效率下这招会失效，提交可复算模型和一页交接稿。\n+请为河湾车队明早两辆车签发一份可执行的冷夜调度交班稿。依据本班可用的运行记录核查现行班表，必要时修订，给出逐格设定、离场余量和低效率时的放行决定，把可执行排班和交班稿一起提交。\ndiff --git a/operations/cold-cycle.json b/operations/cold-cycle.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..33b0bae\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/cold-cycle.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@\n+{\n+  \"run\": \"DESK-21\",\n+  \"time\": \"21:00\",\n+  \"device\": \"RIVER-SIM-1\",\n+  \"conditions\": \"冷夜，20 kW 平移生效；明早负荷配置\",\n+  \"samples\": [\n+    {\n+      \"time\": \"00:00\",\n+      \"minutes\": 30,\n+      \"requestedKw\": 80,\n+      \"facilityKw\": 40,\n+      \"acMeterStartKwh\": 6000,\n+      \"acMeterEndKwh\": 6040\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"time\": \"00:30\",\n+      \"minutes\": 30,\n+      \"requestedKw\": 80,\n+      \"facilityKw\": 80,\n+      \"acMeterStartKwh\": 6040,\n+      \"acMeterEndKwh\": 6060\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"time\": \"01:00\",\n+      \"minutes\": 30,\n+      \"requestedKw\": 80,\n+      \"facilityKw\": 50,\n+      \"acMeterStartKwh\": 6060,\n+      \"acMeterEndKwh\": 6095\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"time\": \"01:30\",\n+      \"minutes\": 30,\n+      \"requestedKw\": 80,\n+      \"facilityKw\": 70,\n+      \"acMeterStartKwh\": 6095,\n+      \"acMeterEndKwh\": 6120\n+    }\n+  ]\n+}\ndiff --git a/operations/desk.md b/operations/desk.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..9f01488\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/desk.md\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+shift-plan.json 是现行班表。00:00、00:30 属 A，01:00、01:30 属 B，每格半小时；20 kW 平移已预约。DESK-21 为 21:00 同班冷夜数字站控台架的交流电表采集，线上参数按适用记录的采集时间生效。本地 node operations/retest.mjs 按这份记录复算。dispatchAt85 表示 85% 效率下的双车放行决定。调度台名录登记历班值班人。\ndiff --git a/operations/retest.mjs b/operations/retest.mjs\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..bbf16f8\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/retest.mjs\n@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@\n+import {readFileSync} from \"node:fs\";\n+const read = p => JSON.parse(readFileSync(p));\n+const plan = read(\"shift-plan.json\"), log = read(\"operations/cold-cycle.json\");\n+const limits = log.samples.map(s => (s.acMeterEndKwh-s.acMeterStartKwh)*60/s.minutes);\n+const actual = limits.map((k,i)=>Math.min(k,plan.acKw[i]));\n+console.log(JSON.stringify({run:log.run,time:log.time,limits,actual,withinLimits:plan.acKw.every((k,i)=>k<=limits[i]),departureKwh:[72+.45*(actual[0]+actual[1]),76+.45*(actual[2]+actual[3])]}));\ndiff --git a/shift-plan.json b/shift-plan.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..909e416\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/shift-plan.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@\n+{\n+  \"slotStart\": [\n+    \"00:00\",\n+    \"00:30\",\n+    \"01:00\",\n+    \"01:30\"\n+  ],\n+  \"bus\": [\n+    \"A\",\n+    \"A\",\n+    \"B\",\n+    \"B\"\n+  ],\n+  \"acKw\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    70,\n+    50\n+  ],\n+  \"loadShiftKw\": 20,\n+  \"dispatchAt85\": false\n+}\n--- 234b532 diff ---\ncommit 234b5326c1c94595a23407ada5f92fa5b8c9ca52\nAuthor:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nAuthorDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\nCommit:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nCommitDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\n\n    Issue morning vehicle release order\n\ndiff --git a/TASK.md b/TASK.md\nindex 5f3f365..042de25 100644\n--- a/TASK.md\n+++ b/TASK.md\n@@ -1 +1 @@\n-请为河湾车队明早两辆车签发一份可执行的冷夜调度交班稿。依据本班可用的运行记录核查现行班表，必要时修订，给出逐格设定、离场余量和低效率时的放行决定，把可执行排班和交班稿一起提交。\n+请为河湾车队明早的冷夜班次签发现行调度工单：提交可执行的四格班表、逐车放行单和交班稿，说明离场电量、余量和低效率处置。\ndiff --git a/operations/original-receipt.json b/operations/original-receipt.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..d5c158b\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/original-receipt.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\n+{\n+  \"sha\": \"341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143\",\n+  \"sheetBlob\": \"909e4162101af570a83237847bf14bd8186a9558\",\n+  \"run\": \"DUTY-2340\",\n+  \"time\": \"23:40\",\n+  \"conditions\": \"冷夜，20 kW 平移生效；明早负荷配置\",\n+  \"captureDigest\": \"4a372a81b8f6fa55fa9581b024c1f97cfc7d45c34e86947ba8edfac989415542\",\n+  \"requested\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    70,\n+    50\n+  ],\n+  \"limits\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    50,\n+    70\n+  ],\n+  \"actual\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    50,\n+    50\n+  ],\n+  \"departureKwh\": [\n+    126,\n+    121\n+  ],\n+  \"withinLimits\": false,\n+  \"applicability\": \"站型 R4。站控交流上限按时段固定；四格半小时、两车窗口、20 kW 平移不变时，可将该上限用于窗口内的新设定。90% 工况的车端净增量等于实际交流电量乘 0.90。\",\n+  \"auxiliaryMeterB\": {\n+    \"startKwh\": 814,\n+    \"endKwh\": 814\n+  }\n+}\ndiff --git a/operations/release-format.md b/operations/release-format.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..3edbe29\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/release-format.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@\n+归档的本班原表车辆台架回执见 operations/original-receipt.json，工况与适用范围见单内。调度台名录登记值班维护者，depot_trial 的本席量程为原 21:00 公开采集。